* fhi     2015-05-18 NOMALL-1552 Show real size, not base64 size
* SU1     2016-02-10 NOMALL-1819 reset rc
* SU2     2018-05-04             NAT ERR in LUW only in english
* fhi     2019-05-13 NOMALL-2272 Correct evaluation of time inverted
* --------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER USING ESMCNT-A
PARAMETER USING ESMINP-A
PARAMETER USING OOPOLW-A
PARAMETER USING OOPOLS-A
* *****
LOCAL USING RMSPL--L
LOCAL USING RTXT---L
LOCAL USING NADA2000
LOCAL USING NAD-MSG
LOCAL USING NAD-FLD
LOCAL USING CONST-L         /* NOMALL-2272 fhi in
*
LOCAL
1 AR VIEW OF NRM-ACTIVE-REPORTS
  2 AR-REPNAME
  2 AR-REPRNB
  2 AR-SOURCE
  2 AR-SENDER
  2 AR-SPOOL-ATTRIBUTES
  2 AR-SPOOL-ATTR-EXTENDED (120)
  2 AR-REPORT-RNB
  2 AR-NUMBER-OF-LINES
  2 AR-PROCESS-TIME
  2 AR-PROCESS-TIME-INV
  2 AR-CC-TYPE
  2 AR-SOURCE-SENDER-TIME-INV
